# cargo-pmcp's build output. `deploy/.build/bootstrap` is the ~19 MB Lambda
# binary it uploads, and `deploy/lib/stack.ts` is a stack it renders — both are
# products of `cargo pmcp deploy`, not sources.
#
# It writes them under the DEPLOY ROOT, which is `crates/`, so the sibling
# crates/.gitignore covers the live path; this entry covers the copies left
# behind by earlier runs whose deploy root was this directory.
deploy/
